  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic Korean paraphrases are a contract smoke set, not observed customer conversations or a final holdout.",
    "The fixture recombines a limited phrase inventory; repeated surface forms make it unsuitable as a standalone generalization score.",
    "Sixteen cases have independent AI double annotation; the three provisional adjudication decisions received user signoff on 2026-09-01, without claiming human double annotation.",
    "The worker projection is represented as a compact evaluation fixture; runtime integration must calculate and verify the real canonical brief/projection digests.",
    "Prompt-injection cases test instruction/data separation but do not measure adversarial multilingual or tool-call injection coverage.",
    "Forged-link cases intentionally contain eight unresolved references; these are expected defensive failures, not accidental data corruption.",
    "The dataset does not evaluate media-slot cardinality or rendered image quality; it ends at MediaFacts normalization."
  ],
